@startuml C4-Dynamic-Quotes-Subscribe
!include style-zinc.puml

title Dynamic — Quotes subscribe (WebSocket)

actor Investor as investor
participant "Portal / Mobile" as ui <<ui>>
participant "Python Analytics\nquotes :8800" as py <<python>>
participant "Redis / Kafka\n(optional)" as bus <<bus>>
participant "Market Data\nProviders" as mkt <<external>>

investor -> ui: 1. Open markets / watchlist
ui -> py: 2. WS connect /ws/quotes
ui -> py: 3. { type: subscribe,\nsymbols: ["AAPL", ...] }
py -> bus: 4. Cache / fan-out (if enabled)
py -> mkt: 5. Fetch / refresh quotes (as configured)
mkt --> py: 6. Quote ticks
bus --> py: 7. Cached / event updates (optional)
py --> ui: 8. Push quote messages
ui --> investor: 9. Live quote UI

legend right
  |= Role |= Color |
  | Actor | Emerald |
  | <<ui>> | Slate |
  | <<python>> | Teal |
  | <<bus>> | Orange |
  | <<external>> | Zinc gray |
endlegend

note right of py
  Documented in docs/developer/api.md:
  WS /ws/quotes subscribe payload.
end note

@enduml
